msgstr "ميزات المتجر الإلكتروني"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/configuration/multi_website.rst:63
msgid ""
"eCommerce features such as products, eCommerce categories, pricelists, "
"discounts, payment providers, etc., can be restricted to :ref:`a specific "
"website <multi-website/website_content>`."
msgstr ""
"يمكن تقييد ميزات المتجر الإلكتروني مثل المنتجات وفئات المتجر الإلكتروني "
