"<multi-website/website_content>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/configuration/multi_website.rst:69
msgid ""
"To :doc:`allow your customers to use the same account <../../ecommerce/"
"configuration/customer_accounts>` on all of your websites, go "
"to :menuselection:`Website --> Configuration --> Settings` and "
"enable :guilabel:`Shared Customer Accounts`."
msgstr ""
":doc:`للسماح لعملائك باستخدام نفس الحساب <../../ecommerce/configuration/"
"customer_accounts>` على جميع مواقعك الإلكترونية، انتقل "
"إلى :menuselection:`الموقع الإلكتروني --> الإعدادات --> الإعدادات` "
"وفعّل :guilabel:`حسابات العملاء المشتركة`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/configuration/multi_website.rst:75
msgid "Pricing"
msgstr "الأسعار"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/configuration/multi_website.rst:77
msgid ""
"Products can be priced differently based on the website "
"using :ref:`pricelists <ecommerce/prices/selectable-pricelists>`. To do so:"
msgstr ""
"يمكن تسعير المنتجات بشكل مختلف بناءً على الموقع الإلكتروني "
